  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Rinse and drain the chickpeas. Cut the cauliflower into small florets. Crush or finely chop 2 garlic cloves. Pick half the coriander leaves, then coarsely chop the remaining coriander, including the stems.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/127686/photos/large/prep_ingredients-d86ba55fd287304ffe02c3a7a16dc53f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Brown cauliflower: Heat 1½ tbs olive oil in a medium deep frypan over medium heat. Cook the cauliflower, garlic and 1 tbs masala seasoning, stirring, for 2 mins or until fragrant.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/127687/photos/large/brown_cauliflower-285ae4f87644692771030c46011ed36e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Simmer masala: Add the chickpeas, tomatoes, 1 tbs tomato paste and 125ml (½ cup) water and bring to the boil. Reduce the heat to medium-low and cook, covered, stirring occasionally, for 15 mins or until the sauce is thickened. Taste, then season with salt and pepper. Remove the pan from the heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/127688/photos/large/cook_masala-ca4e724045468e5175ffc6d0637ec31d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Toast naan: Meanwhile, heat a large frypan over medium heat. Toast the naan, one at a time, for 1 min each side or until lightly golden and warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/127689/photos/large/toast_naan-735452018470876e1825f2bdef2efb05.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Add the chopped coriander to the masala, stir to combine, then divide among bowls. Scatter over the coriander leaves and drizzle with the yoghurt. Serve with the naan and enjoy.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/127690/photos/large/serve_up-6453aee0f8f9e9525636b019cd6f2246.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: If you like your curries with heat, scatter over dried chilli flakes or sliced fresh chilli to serve",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/127691/photos/large/make_it_yours-39fc27782770f7a8e2bb28603fc53505.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
